[% title = "Tags" %]

[% FOR group IN groups %]
<h3>Tag Group [% group.name | html %]</h3>

<p>Tags:
    [% FOR tag IN group.tags %]
    <a href="[% tag.edit_url %]">[% tag.name | html %]</a>
    [% END %]
</p>
[% END %]

<h3>Other Tags</h3>

<p>Tags:
[% FOR tag IN other_tags %]
    <a href="[% tag.edit_url %]">[% tag.name | html %]</a>
[% END %]
</p>

[% WRAPPER includes/infobox.tt %]
    A <em>tag</em> is a keyword which can be attached to <em>recipes</em>, <em>dishes</em> and <em>articles</em> to filter them when your search a specific item out of these categories.
    A <em>tag group</em> can be used to organize similar <em>tags</em> together.
[% END %]
